  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-04T08:59:34.261Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The 2019 Post Processing Layer component seems to have \"Directly To Camera Target\" automatically checked, while that option did not exist in 2018. Having that checked prevents the camera from updating the render texture, breaking some world cameras that use post processing and render to a texture.\n\n*Discovered the cause by upgrading the project to 2019, you can check the world below to see that it renders nothing in 2019, while working fine in 2018)*\n\nWorld link: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_8397c6db-73a3-45f7-9bd6-c8ca9df6e703\nTo turn on the camera - you need to press the Stream Camera button at the DJ table (see screenshots)",
